      "url": "https://x.com/kenkenlewu/status/2119501503639572677",
      "text": "This is the dress you ordered from Temu, and you got exactly what was described.\n\nIf you had clicked on the reviews, as I did here, you would have seen the actual picture and colour of the dress.\n\nWhen shopping on Temu, reviews from previous buyers are often more reliable than the product pictures displayed on the platform. Always check the reviews to see what you are actually paying for before placing an order.",
      "original_text": "This is the dress you ordered from Temu, and you got exactly what was described.\n\nIf you had clicked on the reviews, as I did here, you would have seen the actual picture and colour of the dress.\n\nWhen shopping on Temu, reviews from previous buyers are often more reliable than the product pictures displayed on the platform. Always check the reviews to see what you are actually paying for before placing an order.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "这就是你从 Temu 订的那条裙子，而你收到的和描述完全一致。\n\n如果你像我这里这样点开评论，你就会看到这条裙子的实物图片和颜色。\n\n在 Temu 购物时，之前买家的评论通常比平台上展示的产品图片更可靠。下单前一定要查看评论，看看你实际付钱买的是什么。",
